This program first formats the provided string dates into LocalDate objects, then it iterates over all dates between "start" and "end". If the day of the week for any date is a Friday, it prints it. Please note that this program prints dates assuming the pattern is "MM/dd/yyyy". If the pattern changes, the DateFormatter should be updated accordingly.

