Please replace `'input[type="text"]'` with the actual class or id of your input field if it's not a generalized text field. For input being actively typed character by character check, `'input'` event is used. For detection upon complete input or when the user moves out of the text field, use `'change'` event.

Remember to use this script after the HTML elements are loaded, otherwise, it won't work if the input elements are not loaded before the script runs. It can be done by placing the script at the bottom of your HTML file or by using the window.onload function or JQuery's $(document).ready function.

