Write a Java code to find the maximum of two numbers a and b without using any pre-defined Java method or operator such as Math.max() or if-else conditions. Also, implement error handling protocol to handle any exceptions raised due to invalid inputs. Include comments that explain the logic and flow of your code.

int a = 3;
