This solution is a Vue.js mixin called `paginatedFetch.js`. It introduces `currentPage` and `pageSize` from URL's "page" and "size" parameters. Single Responsibility Principle is observed by only handling pagination-related data in this mixin. Error handling and loading state management is incorporated in `fetchData()` method.

